      "value": "@{5a7ac88bf5a5c52c08064fb9|full_name}: i know about that request, but i decided to create a new one now that WMR is at this point of time an already established platform. Also i wanted to highlight the current issues with vrchat, steamvr and wmr and see if there is a solution by the devs on the vrchat side.",
      "viewerReactions": null
