      "value": "@{5c19a727086ff003df5bf710|full_name}: I am a WMR user. I have no issues with the deadline. I have no issues with the speed and movement with my thumbstick, I can run as fast as I like or as slow as I like and turn as fast as I like or as slow as I like. Better then Vive users and some Oculus users. I have never had to restart the game to get my thumbstick to work. The only time they ever stop working is when I lose tracking for an extended period of time but always regain control when tracking returns. You might have a bad WMR install if you have to restart the game to regain control of your controllers.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
